{
 "title": "回调",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "把函数存放在结构体字段中是事件驱动程序的基础：“当这个事件发生时，调用那个函数”。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "struct Button:",
    "    id: i32",
    "    on_click: fn(i32)",
    "",
    "fn notify(id: i32):",
    "    print(\"button pressed:\", id)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    b = Button{ id: 101, on_click: notify }",
    "    b.on_click(b.id)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "button pressed: 101"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c09-l02-x1",
   "prompt": "构建一个 `Timer` 结构体（`name: str`，`on_finish: fn(str)`）。用一个 `report(name)` 函数（输出 `finished: ` 和名字）作为 `on_finish`，并对 `Timer{ name: \"tea\", ... }` 调用它。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    print(\"?\")"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "struct Timer:",
    "    name: str",
    "    on_finish: fn(str)",
    "",
    "fn report(name: str):",
    "    print(\"finished:\", name)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    t = Timer{ name: \"tea\", on_finish: report }",
    "    t.on_finish(t.name)"
   ],
   "hint": "字段类型是 `fn(str)`，调用方式是 `t.on_finish(t.name)`。",
   "expected": [
    "finished: tea"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c09-l02-q1",
   "q": "如何调用存放在结构体字段中的函数？",
   "options": [
    "`b.on_click(b.id)`",
    "`call(b.on_click)`",
    "无法调用"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "why": "该字段是一个函数值，所以用括号调用。"
  }
 ]
}
